 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Of course. Do you want stick to mostly pantry items, or would you like to order in and not worry about the kitchen? The basics really help. Bread, rice, pasta, lentils, nuts, seeds, oats, avocado, fruit, tofu, and most vegetables. That's the tricky one. Read labels carefully, soy sauce can hide in surprising places like canned tomatoes. It's definitely a treat again, just made safer. Would you like me to find a gluten free recipe for tonight, or order in?",
